<Docs title="Why the model never sees the value — Botpasses" crumbs={[{ href: "/docs", label: "Docs" }, { href: "/docs/explanation/why-the-model-never-sees-the-value", label: "Why" }]}>
  <h1>Why the model never sees the value</h1>
  <p>If a secret is in the context window, it can be logged, replayed, or leaked in a later turn. Botpasses keeps the value in the vault process and injects it only into the tool environment.</p>
